  "shortLabel": "Operational Audit",
  "icon": "ClipboardCheck",
  "description": "Plan and execute operational audits across manufacturing and business operations. Covers audit programme design, audit scope definition, control assessment, finding classification, and reporting. Produces detailed findings reports and gap scoring matrices with risk-rated findings, root causes, and corrective action recommendations aligned with ISO 19011 audit principles.",
